title the bit season opens; the DJINN deep debride; eleven silo pages
prompt Keaton opened the Bit Design System season (DJINN ready, Linengrow the starting inspiration) and widened the round in flight: rename the collaborator to the pseudonym DJINN -- given name, surname, filenames, session logs, and the whole git history; weave in the public handle; survey DJINN's repositories against Grain; silo the Linengrow first-cloth Gauge pass; extract the toroidal archive with math checks; silo photonic-thermodynamic computing and the aether-field lens; improve the seed scrub; then send seed and xy with the force push granted.
think The season molt ran breach-first: the launcher heredocs swapped pause for OPENS, Realidream and WADE each left a living mutant file at a fresh stamp with bannered fossils and Class M rows, and four season witness scripts repointed their grep calls to the mutant paths and the archive file now holding the shred-prep crawl text -- two had drifted RED before the round, and the repoint closed them.
think The debride ran checkpoint-first at walk-back 0a1d3e51ef: a word-boundary sweep over 239 tracked files plus four lowercase-only stragglers the capital-selected list missed, two dated filenames renamed, the POLE registry row moved to hand-seated with its input debrided and the sealed body re-sealed, the derive witness given a hand-seated row check, and the sow wall re-spelled with bracketed character classes so the guard survives the name it guards against.
think The clone was shallow at 38 commits; unshallow pulled 3,468 before the rewrite, because a rewritten shallow history force-pushed would truncate the pier. filter-repo swept every blob, 11 commit messages, and 4 path forms in 214 seconds; filter-branch re-signed all 3,468; refs/original dropped and gc run; the pickaxe reads zero for both names in every form, with only Hertzian -- the physicist -- surviving on purpose.
think Three research agents fanned out: the toroidal archive read (13 unique pre-repo writings, figure-by-figure recompute catching a VRAM slip and a dangling-slice bug), the photonic-thermodynamic company survey (13 threads dated 2026-08-26), and the aether-field lens with each figure's standing named plainly. Nine pages filed; the report took a claim-preserving register pass, 78 to 94, every digit-run and backtick span proven identical.
obs A blanket sweep selected by capitalized names missed files carrying only the lowercase form; the census after the sweep caught them, which is why the census runs after.
obs The sow projection now preserves the exec bit on scrubbed files -- the seed's own commit-msg hook was shipping disarmed at 100644, and the sed-to-dest copy was the reason.
obs QA cards on the thirteen new pages: 94 98 95 90 for the season set, 94 83 84 86 84 86 for the toroidal set after the pass, 88 95 97 for the photonic set -- all B or better, one molt frame opened and closed.
